asily now. The price is that it can no longer shed its shell.","abilities":["Curls up and stops attacking when your units are nearby, or if <Lord of Thunder> is on the field."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":450,"def":300,"res":25,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"raging_gloomweaver":{"slug":"raging_gloomweaver","name":"Raging Gloomweaver","icon":"/enemies-icons/Raging Gloomweaver.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Collapsal","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A Gloomweaver corrupted by the curse; a dangerous foe that spews threads that also carry the curse. Those bound by its threads become either its food or slaves to the curse.","abilities":["Fires threads at the allied unit with the highest HP in Attack Range, dealing continuous Stun and Arts damage.","Wyvern Riding: Raging Gloomweaver moves to target location and fires threads at the 3 enemies with the highest HP in Attack Range, dealing continuous Stun and Arts damage, then leaves the field."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":19500,"atk":325,"def":700,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"cursed_rocksheller":{"slug":"cursed_rocksheller","name":"Cursed Rocksheller","icon":"/enemies-icons/Cursed Rocksheller.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Collapsal","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Rocksheller corrupted by the curse, which has strengthened its forelimbs and given it the power to easily alter the terrain. It is the only thing that can threaten the Lord of Thunder, and as such has become the Lord of Thunder's target.","abilities":["Creates 'Weathered Fragments' in the 4 adjacent tiles, causing those tiles to be undeployable.","Wyvern Riding: Cursed Rocksheller emerges at target location, creating deployable Entrench